3-59/10 * * * *  flowpilot  /srv/flowpilot/backend/deploy/bin/flowpilot-sweep erp_postings --apply
# ARCH49-S1:cron-process. Every 15 minutes: one process sweep job per enabled
# workspace and slot (idempotent on the slot; the job runs on the LIGHT worker).
8-59/15 * * * *  flowpilot  /srv/flowpilot/backend/deploy/bin/flowpilot-sweep process --apply
# ARCH50-S1:cron-revops. Daily: end contracts past their term, issue invoices for
# periods that started, expire unused promo reservations, freeze last month's
# revenue snapshot, prune egress refusals past 90 days (idempotent; LIGHT job).
23 3 * * *  flowpilot  /srv/flowpilot/backend/deploy/bin/flowpilot-sweep revops --apply
