# newest heartbeat present bounds the data lost: the measured RPO). Every 5
# minutes the WAL archive is checked; nightly a base backup; weekly a timed
# point-in-time restore drill into a scratch cluster (RPO and RTO recorded).
* * * * *  flowpilot  /srv/flowpilot/backend/deploy/bin/flowpilot-sweep dr-heartbeat
41 1 * * *  flowpilot  /srv/flowpilot/backend/deploy/bin/flowpilot-sweep base-backup
